From 611305ceb5f711dc6595df3522d3baea9e2e5dc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sim <sim@local>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:25:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Ledger tests for the 256 tier + dev-256 CI workflow

MemoryBudgetParallel256Test: 14 ledger tests over the real production
source - byte-accurate depth (256x1MB on the 2GB tier -> 175 chunks, never
the 257-chunk oversell; 512KB chunks funded at their real size -> 350),
connection clamps by tier (174/349/474 + composed guard presets), and the
adaptive hedge threshold (legacy fallback without samples, quarter-median
protection for throttled-healthy connections, 16 KB/s absolute floor,
no regression on fast lines).

dev-256-build.yml: push/workflow_dispatch CI for the 256 development
branch - runs the full :app:testFullDebugUnitTest suite, then builds the
fullDebug APK (CI-keystore signed) and uploads it as a 14-day artifact.
The release workflow stays untouched.
---
